5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's get started! I'm curious about our talent pipeline and who's actually available to help our new companies grow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I think we need to be more honest about our past performance and what actually drove our returns.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I agree, but we also need to look at our liquidity and how we handle follow-on funding.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know why our reporting takes so long! I'm looking into the audit and verification process.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm concerned about deployment delays. I want to see what's actually holding up our first customers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, do you think the recruiter data would help your view on returns?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,Not necessarily. I'm more interested in the actual customer retention numbers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, would the credit line terms be useful for your deployment concerns?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I think the independent checks are the most important part for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll stick to the security reviews and delivery records for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll take the recruiter times and the adviser bench.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,I'll go with the exit profiles and account retention.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the reserve accounts and the credit line terms.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm choosing appraisal needs and independent checks.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll take security review time and delivery records.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
