60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"We have Fabric Loop, Harvest Sensor, Ledger Bridge, and Clinic Scheduler. I'm leaning toward Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,George,,"Ledger Bridge fits the ""back-office tool"" profile that actually exits profitably for us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Ledger Bridge is software, so it won't require the heavy equipment reserves that Fabric Loop would.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Ledger Bridge is great for reporting, but @Mizuki, what about the security review?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Financial records take time, but medical records for Clinic Scheduler are just as bad.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Harvest Sensor needs field crews, which I know we can't find quickly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,George,,And Fabric Loop has those physical premises that led to our only write-off.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"Ledger Bridge's subscription model is a risk for the credit line, but better than the alternative.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I can't stand the thought of another six-week appraisal for hardware. No to Harvest and Fabric.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,Ledger Bridge is the safest bet for deployment speed compared to the others.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm voting Ledger Bridge. It's the most balanced.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,George,,I agree. Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,Ledger Bridge it is.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm with you all. Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
